DATA USE RESTRICTIONS ON TEST SET

The MIT License above applies to the source code and documentation of this 
repository. It does not apply to the test dataset files included in this repository, 
specifically:
- test.csv
- test.bin
- debug_introduction_notebook_submission.csv

These fall under the following conditiions:

1. COMPETITION RULES FOR TEST SET
   Access to and use of the test set is strictly 
   conditional upon agreeing to the terms and rules of the AI Cup 2026 – 
   Performance Track competition. By accessing these files, you acknowledge 
   that you have read and agreed to the rules located at:
   https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/ai-cup-2026-performance/rules, especially section 2.4 Competition Data

   This condition holds until the data is explicitly revealed by the compeition organizers.

2. NO REVERSE ENGINEERING OF TEST SET
   You may not attempt to reverse engineer, de-anonymize, or manually label 
   the test set data.

   You agree that you use the test data only to calculate, submit and debug submissions for the 
   AI Cup 2026 competition only until the test data, if it happens, is revealed by the competition organizers.

3. NOT SHARED OUTSIDE THE COMPETITION
   If you copy, merge, publish, distribute and/or sublicense copies of the test datset, 
   that would violate the competition rules (such as sharing outside the kaggle system)
   you should remove the specified files belonging to the test set.

4. DISCLAIMER
   THE DATASET IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
   IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
   FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE
   AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER
   LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,
   OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE DATASET OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE
   DATASET.
   
